OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FOscar-winning Irish actress Brenda
OL,8,FFricker has been remembered as a
OL,9,Fmischievous and kind "free spirit" who
OL,10,Fwas happiest in the historic area of
OL,11,FDublin where she lived.
OL,13,FLocals applauded as her wicker coffin
OL,14,Farrived at St Catherine's Church on
OL,15,FMeath Street, adorned with a green
OL,16,Fcloth bearing a gold harp and a coat
OL,17,Fof arms of Dublin.
OL,19,FFricker, 81, died in Our Lady's
OL,20,FHospice in Dublin's Harold's Cross on
OL,21,FJuly 16 after a period of ill health.
OL,26,@qD@VOUqD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
