PN,41202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FMourners heard that she wanted her
OL,8,Ffuneral to be "no fuss" with "no grand
OL,9,Fdisplay" and full of laughter.
OL,11,FHer friend Liz Duffy, described as
OL,12,F"her rock", thanked the local shops in
OL,13,Fthe Liberties that Fricker would go to
OL,14,Fregularly with her dog, Juno.
OL,26,@pD@OOUpD@WO]pD@^OUqD@HO]tD@AOUtD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/16
