PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FThese included her hairdresser Jane,
OL,8,Fwho came up to the hospital to do
OL,9,FFricker's hair when she was ill, Sean
OL,10,Ffrom Foley's pharmacy, who also helped
OL,11,Fduring her illness, her fish shop
OL,12,Fwhere she would order "a huge piece of
OL,13,Fsalmon", Fran the jeweller, and Rachel
OL,14,Fat Fuscos chipper where "Juno got all
OL,15,Fher treats".
OL,17,F"Please, please be happy for her,
OL,18,Fbecause that's what she wanted `
OL,19,Fsmiles and laughter and funny stories."
OL,26,@tD@WOUuD@GO]vD@YOUwD@KO]yD@AOU{D@gO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
