PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FJailhouse Rock was played as Fricker's
OL,8,Fcoffin was carried out of the church
OL,9,Fat the end of the service, prompting
OL,10,Fsome people who had gathered outside
OL,11,Fto dance and sing along.
OL,13,FIrish actor Brendan Gleeson, filmmaker
OL,14,FJim Sheridan, RTE director general
OL,15,FKevin Bakhurst, broadcasters Brendan
OL,16,FO'Connor and Ray D'Arcy, and costume
OL,17,Fdesigner Joan Bergin were among those
OL,18,Fwho attended the funeral service in
OL,19,Fthe Liberties neighbourhood.
OL,26,@vD@Qrb
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
