OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FMourners heard that while Fricker won
OL,8,Fa best supporting actress Oscar for
OL,9,Fher performance as Bridget Fagan Brown
OL,10,Fin 1989's My Left Foot, the trophy was
OL,11,Fnot what mattered to her.
OL,13,FMonsignor Eoin Thynne said she played
OL,14,Fthe role of Mrs Brown "with such
OL,15,Ftruth, such heart, such tenderness
OL,16,Fthat we all felt we knew her".
OL,26,@vD@WOUxD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,F"But in truth, Brenda was like that
OL,8,Fall along. You see, she didn't have to
OL,9,Fact kindness; she lived kindness. Her
OL,10,Fgenerosity was legendary. She gave
OL,11,Ffreely, gladly, often lightly,
OL,12,Fexpecting nothing in return."
OL,14,F"She gave freely and brought dignity
OL,15,Fand truth to every role and
OL,16,Ffriendship. Ireland is prouder because
OL,17,Fof her."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@]O]vD@AOUyD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FHe said there was not "an ounce of
OL,8,Fairs or graces about her", that she
OL,9,Fwas a "free spirit" who was "full of
OL,10,Fmischief" and "marched to the beat of
OL,11,Fher own wonderful, joyful drum".
OL,13,F"We all know the golden rule of
OL,14,FBrenda's day: never call or text
OL,15,Fbefore 12 noon. She liked her
OL,16,Fmornings, and who could blame her?
OL,18,F"And I'm sure we can almost hear
OL,19,FBrenda saying to Peter 'For goodness'
OL,20,Fsake, don't text or call me before
OL,21,F12."
OL,26,@oD@WOUpD@YO]qD@GOUqD@SO]qD@]OUrD@IO]rD@
OL,26,AOOUsD@_O]uD@AOUzD@AOU}D@EO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FHe thanked her neighbours and friends
OL,8,Ffrom the Liberties "where she could be
OL,9,Fherself and was happiest when she was
OL,10,Famong her own".
OL,12,F"This was her spiritual home and she
OL,13,Fsoon discovered that she was a Liberty
OL,14,FBelle at heart, because the people of
OL,15,Fthe Liberties are a special breed.
OL,26,@pD@TOUrD@NO]tD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,F"It's no wonder that Brenda settled
OL,8,Fhere among God's own people. She loved
OL,9,Fthe old world, the old Dublin, the
OL,10,Fstreets that held stories, the
OL,11,Ftraditions that bind us together, the
OL,12,Fwarmth of a greeting and a helping
OL,13,Fhand without being asked."
OL,15,FFilmmaker Tadhg O'Sullivan said he
OL,16,Ffirst met Brenda in her house for what
OL,17,Fwould become to be her last film.
OL,19,F"I came away from that meeting feeling
OL,20,Fstrangely noticed, deeply seen, and
OL,21,Fclosely heard," he said.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@ZO]{D@AOU}D@OO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G9/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,F"As I got to know Brenda, I realised
OL,8,Fthat this was not unique to me, or to
OL,9,Fthat day. Brenda noticed, she was
OL,10,Fremarkably attentive to people and to
OL,11,Ftheir complexities, attuned to
OL,12,Fwhatever it was that made them
OL,13,Funiquely human.
OL,15,F"I began to think that it was this
OL,16,Fattention, this noticing, that had
OL,17,Fbeen a part of her remarkable talent
OL,18,Fas an actor."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOUzD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FHe also said she also looked for the
OL,8,Fsame level of attention back from
OL,9,Fothers.
OL,11,F"When I saw her for the last time a
OL,12,Ffew weeks ago, she joked that here, on
OL,13,Fthis day, anyone whose attention
OL,14,Fwavered from the main act ` maybe to
OL,15,Fcomment on somebody's outfit or to
OL,16,Fnotice the beautiful stained glass
OL,17,Fwindows ` might find themselves
OL,18,Fshocked back into focus by a familiar
OL,19,Fscolding voice emanating from the
OL,20,Fcoffin."
OL,26,@sD@AOU|D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FFilmmaker Virginia Gilbert said that
OL,8,FFricker had said she was "ferocious in
OL,9,Fher friendships" and had been a friend
OL,10,F"by her side" for 15 years.
OL,12,F"When she loved you, she loved fully
OL,13,Fand deeply, and with her whole self,
OL,14,Fnot consuming, but renewing, boosting
OL,15,Fand encouraging, warning and
OL,16,Fadmonishing, pleading and vulnerable,
OL,17,Fand everything so powerfully human and
OL,18,Fhumane."
OL,26,@pD@ZOUqD@PO]rD@AOUrD@MO]tD@AOUzD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41213
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,FMonsignor Thynne said she would often
OL,8,Fvisit the grotto to Mary next to the
OL,9,Fchurch and the cinema.
OL,11,F"She was an actor through and through,
OL,12,Fliving her art not just when the
OL,13,Fcamera rolled or when the lights came
OL,14,Fup, but every single day of her life.
OL,15,FShe loved an audience. She loved you,
OL,16,Fher friends, her family, her
OL,17,Fneighbours, her crew.
OL,26,@sD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G13/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41214
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,F"You were her favourite audience of
OL,8,Fall, she loved the magic of the
OL,9,Fcinema, the thrill of the curtain
OL,10,Frising at the theatre, where stories
OL,11,Fcame alive, and where dreams took
OL,12,Fflight.
OL,14,F"Brenda lived a life full to the brim,
OL,15,Ffull of love, laughter, stories,
OL,16,Fkindness, and mischief, and she was
OL,17,Fvery clear about what she wanted
OL,18,Ftoday: no tears, no sadness, no fuss.
OL,20,F"This is not a day for sorrow.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU|D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G14/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41215
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786042168
OL,3,CBrenda Fricker remembered as
OL,4,Cmischievous 'free spirit' at Dublin
OL,5,Cfuneral
OL,7,F"This is a day of celebration, the
OL,8,Fcelebration of a true legend who
OL,9,Ftouched the lives of so many and left
OL,10,Fus with many, many wonderful memories."
OL,12,FHe added: "The curtain has fallen on
OL,13,Fthis life, but what a performance it
OL,14,Fwas."
OL,16,FAfter the service, locals touched the
OL,17,Fwicker coffin and blessed themselves
OL,18,Fbefore the hearse left, drawing
OL,19,Fapplause from locals again.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@gO]tD@KOUvD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G15/16
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
